                </h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
                  {goldenVisaMinInvestmentEUR != null
                    ? `While citizenship is discretionary, the ${name} Golden Visa grants up to 10-year renewable residency through investment from about ${formatEuro(goldenVisaMinInvestmentEUR)}, with a published fee schedule and processing timeline.`
                    : `While citizenship is discretionary, the ${name} Golden Visa grants long-term renewable residency through investment with a clear fee schedule and timeline instead of an unpredictable nomination process.`}
                </p>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-lead-modal-open
                  data-service-type="Golden Visa"
