            </h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-200">
              {goldenVisa
                ? `Full citizenship is hard to get but the ${name} Golden Visa and nomination-for-investors route are far more attainable. Get matched with a licensed immigration specialist for a free, no-obligation eligibility check.`
                : `Get matched with a vetted immigration advisor for a free, no-obligation eligibility check on your fastest route to ${name}.`}
            </p>
            <button
              type="button"
              data-lead-modal-open
              data-service-type={goldenVisa ? 'Golden Visa' : 'Legal Help'}
              data-target-iso={iso2}
              data-title={goldenVisa ? `Speak to a specialist about the ${name} Golden Visa` : `Get matched on your fastest route to ${name}`}
              data-subtitle={goldenVisa
                ? `Full citizenship is hard to get but the ${name} Golden Visa and nomination-for-investors route are far more attainable. Get a free, no-obligation eligibility check.`
                : `Get matched with a vetted immigration advisor for a free, no-obligation eligibility check on your fastest route to ${name}.`}
              class="mt-4 inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-gold-400"
            >
              {goldenVisa ? 'Check Golden Visa eligibility →' : 'Get matched, free →'}
            </button>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-300">Partner referral we may earn a fee if you engage.</p>
          </div>

          <div id="alert" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-lg shadow-black/5 ring-1 ring-slate-200" data-lead>
            <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Get {name} citizenship updates</h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Law changes and route openings, straight to your inbox.</p>
            <form class="lead-form" data-service-type="Updates" data-target-iso={iso2}>
              <div class="lead-fields mt-4 space-y-3">
                <input
                  type="email"
                  required
                  placeholder="you@example.com"
                  class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-gold-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold-500/40"
                />
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  class="w-full rounded-lg bg-brand-700 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50 transition hover:bg-brand-800"
